# A look part is observed under its object like the drawing's own parts (id <code>.<index>), as the word that names it
# (k.parts.name slot: "hair" for the front and the back hair, "shirt" for what is worn on the upper body), with its slot
# as its name and role, its variant, the colour it is drawn in and its box on the page: an editor and a reader address
# "her hair" or "his hat" as any part.
